WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.447
Once the patient admission interface exists, later reports can start from it.

00:00:05.447 --> 00:00:10.022
This query groups the reusable admission rows by department.

00:00:10.022 --> 00:00:16.057
The report author does not need to repeat patient joins or stay-duration calculations.

00:00:16.057 --> 00:00:19.197
That is the value of modular S Q L.

00:00:19.197 --> 00:00:23.853
stable logic is centralized, and consumer queries become smaller.
